(
    title: "Exocet",
    description: Some("A UFO skims a scrolling fortress surface, weaving through the fire of tall and short defence towers with full eight-way movement. Destroy ten and a tunnel opens — you get three chances to dive in before the barrage accelerates — and the underground levels replay the fight in passages that squeeze tighter each time. A Taiwanese original that resurfaced for years under new names: Space Eagle, and in 1987 as Froggo\'s Cruise Missile and Zellers\' Radar."),
